674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DvFHGXcpZk4Q7kNvwHd0-Fa&_nc_oc=Adrw5QKTSFjd1W9mIFC39PHjxx1Sv87QzfupEaxrXIXQ3At5JEib5-nF2TC4NkK2pN4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQALGIYT22bFdczlumiVb_xY1Ho1HtZnEmMjyfFzZaZVZA&oe=6A58EB59"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hdInjEFeoDUQ7kNvwHJqw8m&_nc_oc=AdrqDEVVoYr482ai3Bq0Rv7r7UrD5hsInUWj-G-qClWzug77E_hosBTngaBFN2ZjbvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBhwYr7hOs_5k1_ZPp3yZdbYWuA6NlC1J8153NL6sv8Gg&oe=6A58F416"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h2J74CMWURAQ7kNvwGni0j4&_nc_oc=AdriJySi54vTduTEn5-c3noDC5svi2G7wzwyO_o-xNseoVLySXLWuI1ifyzJlgVNFZo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAvmAB4IuvjCsmXsO0wC-6ydf0U80U-VvDBCUlBVDTA8g&oe=6A58F031"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip